--   Fundamental groups under constant field extension: functoriality, constants and descent of unramified extensions (EtPi1Geo library, file 01)
-- statement:
--   Library for comparing fundamental groups of curves over a finite field and over its algebraic closure. For a domain $A$ with fraction field $K$, $K_U \subset \overline{K}$ is the maximal extension of $K$ unramified over $A$ and $\pi_1 = \mathrm{Gal}(K_U/K)$ (Krull topology); for $K$ of characteristic $p$ and $q$ a power of $p$, $\pi_1^{\mathrm{geo}} \le \pi_1$ is the subgroup fixing every constant ($x^{q^n} = x$). Built on the flat curve library (`Def_RPLib_F2_032`). Contents, in dependency order:
--
--   * base change of finite Galois extensions along a field embedding $K \to K'$ (splitting fields of the same polynomial), and preservation of unramifiedness, giving the functoriality map $\pi_1(A', K') \to \pi_1(A, K)$ (restriction to $K_U(A, K)$), its continuity and its action on constants;
