--   * the field hypotheses for a constant field extension $FK = F(k)$ with $k$ algebraically closed and algebraic over $\mathbb{F}_q$: generation by constants, algebraicity, constants of $\overline{FK}$, and integrality of $\mathbb{F}_q[X] \to k[X]$.
